<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Marrow — Test Coverage Mapping for Engineers</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html, body {
            height: 100%;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .hero {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 2rem;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #f9f9f9 100%);
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 700px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .eyebrow {
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.15em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #666666;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.2;
            letter-spacing: 0.2em;
            color: #1a1a1a;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            word-spacing: 0.1em;
        }

        .subtext {
            font-size: 1.125rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #444444;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        .cta-group {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1rem;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .cta-primary {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #FF6B00;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 0.875rem 2rem;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(255, 107, 0, 0.2);
        }

        .cta-primary:hover {
            background-color: #e55a00;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(255, 107, 0, 0.3);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .cta-primary:active {
            transform: translateY(0);
            box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(255, 107, 0, 0.2);
        }

        .cta-primary:focus {
            outline: 2px solid #FF6B00;
            outline-offset: 2px;
        }

        .cta-secondary {
            display: inline-block;
            color: #FF6B00;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color 0.2s ease;
            border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
        }

        .cta-secondary:hover {
            color: #e55a00;
            border-bottom-color: #e55a00;
        }

        .cta-secondary:focus {
            outline: 2px solid #FF6B00;
            outline-offset: 2px;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .trust-line {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #888888;
            font-family: "SF Mono", Monaco, "Cascadia Code", "Roboto Mono", Menlo, Courier, monospace;
            letter-spacing: 0.03em;
        }

        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            h1 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }

            .subtext {
                font-size: 1rem;
            }

            .cta-group {
                gap: 0.75rem;
            }

            .hero {
                padding: 1.5rem;
            }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            .cta-primary,
            .cta-secondary {
                transition: none;
            }

            .cta-primary:hover {
                transform: none;
            }
        }

        @media (min-width: 641px) {
            .cta-group {
                flex-direction: row;
                justify-content: center;
                gap: 2rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <div class="eyebrow">Open source · MIT</div>
            <h1>Know what your tests actually cover.</h1>
            <p class="subtext">Marrow watches a single test run and draws the real map from test to code — no coverage annotations, no config. Find the dead tests. Find the untested lines. In one command.</p>
            <div class="cta-group">
                <button class="cta-primary">Install Marrow</button>
                <a href="#" class="cta-secondary">Read the docs</a>
            </div>
            <div class="trust-line">Works with pytest, Jest, and go test.</div>
        </div>
    </section>
</body>
</html>'})]

